# Phase 3 — SSH Service & Remote Access

## Practical Commands

The following commands were used during the practical lab.

### 1. Check the Company Directories

```bash
# Check the company directories
ls /opt/company
```

### 2. Check OpenSSH Installation

```bash
# Check OpenSSH installation
sudo apt install openssh-server
```

### 3. Enable and Start the SSH Service

```bash
# Enable and start the SSH service
sudo systemctl enable --now ssh
```

### 4. Check if SSH Is Active

```bash
# Check if SSH is active
systemctl is-active ssh
```

### 5. Test SSH Connection Locally

```bash
# Test SSH connection locally
ssh localhost
```

### 6. Check the Current User

```bash
# Check the current user
whoami
```
